YieldcoinShare_unpause
├── when the caller does not have UNPAUSER_ROLE
│   └── it should revert with AccessControlUnauthorizedAccount
├── when the token is unpaused
│   └── it should revert with ExpectedPause
└── when the caller has UNPAUSER_ROLE and the token is paused
    ├── it should unpause the token
    └── it should emit Unpaused
